{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>到日本寺院參拜，收集御朱印已成為極具儀式感嘅行程！位於東京早稻田附近、以「花手水」聞名嘅「萬年山法輪寺」，就憑藉一系列極致精緻嘅「花卉剪紙御朱印」喺網上爆紅！萬年山法輪寺公布9月起的秋天御朱印，以彼岸花為主題。官方表示即使彼岸花御朱印推出至今已歷經兩年，回看時依然覺得設計歷久彌新、無可挑剔，因此果斷決定不作任何修正！將經典設計帶給大家！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179026561655341062_6620683426ab5491139262.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179026561919119342_14800169196ab549135ae21.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179026562062958899_16744055936ab54914d62e6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179026562236351973_16506688686ab549168337e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179026562378942921_16005736836ab549180ac76.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179026562540072366_5676314116ab549199045d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T16:21:01.368514+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":240,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}